    {
      "id": "file:Specs/addDefaultMatchers.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "addDefaultMatchers.js",
      "filePath": "Specs/addDefaultMatchers.js",
      "summary": "CesiumJS 测试套件的核心匹配器定义文件，为 Jasmine 注册大量针对 3D 场景的自定义匹配器，包括渲染结果比对、pick 结果比对、TypedArray 相等性判断以及异步 toThrow 变体。",
      "tags": ["test", "matcher", "jasmine", "webgl", "rendering"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "通过 makeThrowFunction 工厂为每个匹配器动态生成断言失败消息函数；createDefaultMatchers 是一个超过 500 行的巨型工厂，集中返回所有 matcher 对象。"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:Specs/customizeJasmine.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "customizeJasmine.js",
      "filePath": "Specs/customizeJasmine.js",
      "summary": "Jasmine 测试环境定制入口，根据传入的类别、webgl 校验/stub、release 等配置覆盖 describe/xdescribe 行为、注册 beforeEach、调用 addDefaultMatchers 并注入自定义相等性比较器。",
      "tags": ["test", "jasmine", "configuration", "setup"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:Specs/equals.js",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "equals.js",
      "filePath": "Specs/equals.js",
